EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}It's not like I'm giving you orders!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I'm just talking about how you can
be more graceful!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}¡Perdona por preocuparme por
ti! ¡Solo intento darte consejos para
que seas un poco más femenina!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Non mi sto mettendo a darti ordini!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ti sto solo dando consigli su come
comportarti da vera signora!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Ich möchte dir gar nichts befehlen.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich versuche nur, dir zu erläutern,
wie man sich damenhaft benimmt.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Sana emir vermiyorum ki!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sadece nasıl daha zarif olabileceğini
anlatıyorum!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0008:}}Whaddaya mean?!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Arggh!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Why do
some people try to please everyone
by never having an opinion?!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0008:}}¡¿Pero a ti se te va la olla?!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} ¡Grrr!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
¡Buf, odio las medias tintas! ¡Y a la
gente que hace la pelota!
A mí me gusta que me digan las
cosas bien claritas, ¡y a la cara!
¿Lo captas?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0008:}}Raaaah !!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Mais quelle chiffe molle !{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Ça t'défriserait de t'mouiller un peu
pour une fois ?!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0008:}}Sul serio?!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Argggh!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Perché certa
gente, pur di stare simpatica a tutti,
non dice cosa pensa?!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0008:}}Boah, das darf doch wohl nich'
wahr sein!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Gah!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Wie kann man zu so
'nem Thema keine Meinung haben?!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0008:}}Ne demek yani?!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Aaargh!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} İnsanlar niye
fikir belirtmeyip herkesi memnun etmeye
çalışır ki?!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0008:}}Très juste !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ça ne se fait pas de fuir
le débat alors même que ton avis
vient d'être sollicité !{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0008:}}Su questo sono d'accordo con te!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Se ti si chiede un'opinione, non puoi
tirarti indietro.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} È maleducazione!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0008:}}So seh ich das ebenfalls!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Es ist sehr
unhöflich, ambivalent zu sein, wenn
die eigene Meinung gefragt ist.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0008:}}Ben de aynen öyle düşünüyorum!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} İnsanlar
görüşüne ihtiyaç duyuyorsa tartışmadan
kaçamazsın.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Bu kabalık!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}C'est bien la première fois que nous
sommes d'accord sur quelque
chose !{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0012:}}What?!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} You can't just say it like
that without even thinking about it!

{{TAG:0003:0007:}}Even I'm not that conceited! {{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0012:}}Was?!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Das haste jetzt einfach
so dahergesagt, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}ohne drüber
nachzudenken!
{{TAG:0003:0007:}}Dachteste, mir fällt das nich' auf,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
nur weil du mir zugestimmt hast?! {{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0012:}}Ne?!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Hiç düşünmeden öylece
söyleyemezsin ki!

{{TAG:0003:0007:}}Ben bile o kadar kendini beğenmiş değilim! {{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0008:}}Ganz meiner Meinung!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Wir führen
eine ernst zu nehmende Diskussion
und du würdigst das gar nicht.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}As am I!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I thought you would put a
little more thought into it!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0007:}}This is a
serious discussion, after all!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}¡Y yo!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Deberías haber reflexionado
un poco más antes de contestar.
{{TAG:0003:0007:}}¡Es una discusión muy seria!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Et moi donc !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Tu aurais au moins pu
faire semblant de réfléchir avant de
t'exprimer !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0007:}}C'est un débat sérieux !{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}You gotta have the newspaper
